    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43817" root="&#xA;                        نبه&#xA;                    " body-key="n1">
                        
                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَلِمَةُ تَنْبِيهٍ</span></b> 
                        
                        <i>A word used to give notice,</i> to a
person addressed, of something about to be said
to him. (TA, voce <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هَا</span>.) See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هَا</span> termed <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَنْبِيهٌ</span>.
It may generally be rendered <i>Now.</i>
